                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d157-f2" n="2" xml:id="d157-f2-content">
                <p>Under reference here is a letter of August 20 from the Australian Mission to the
                    United Nations to the United Nations Secretary-General, circulated in the United
                    Nations as document A/948.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
